### =====================================================================
### END-TO-END (Phase 10): online payment deadline and the admin payment summary, through the gateway (8080)
###
###   An ONLINE order that nobody pays: after the deadline the payment fails ("Not paid in time"),
###   the order is cancelled by the SYSTEM and the reserved stock goes back on the shelf.
###
### Needs: every service of Phases 1-9 + the connectors. Start payment-service with a SHORT deadline,
### otherwise step 7 waits 15 minutes:
###   $env:ONLINE_PAYMENT_TIMEOUT="1m"; $env:PAYMENT_TIMEOUT_CHECK_INTERVAL="10s"; .\mvnw spring-boot:run
### (Razorpay itself is tested with test keys - see payment-service/http/payment-service.http, requests 16-19.)
### Written for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run the requests IN ORDER.
### =====================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@vendorToken = {{vendorLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@unpaidOrderId = {{unpaidOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}


### 1. customer1 (user 4) logs in
# @name customerLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 2. The admin logs in
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 3. vendor1 (Fresh Mart) logs in
# @name vendorLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor1@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 4. customer1 starts with an empty cart
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 5. ...adds 3 x Farm Eggs (3 x 48.00)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 8,
  "quantity": 3
}


### 6. ...and orders ONLINE (the stock is reserved, then the payment waits for the customer)
# @name unpaidOrder
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "ONLINE"
}


### 7. (wait) AWAITING_PAYMENT, canPayNow true, payBefore = the deadline
# @wait 4
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/payments/orders/{{unpaidOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 8. vendor1's stock of eggs: 3 reserved for this order
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/inventory/8
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 9. (wait) The customer never pays. After the deadline -> FAILED "Not paid in time" (PaymentFailed)
# @wait 80
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/payments/orders/{{unpaidOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 10. The order was cancelled by the SYSTEM: "Payment failed: Not paid in time"
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{unpaidOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 11. Paying now is too late -> 400 "This payment cannot be paid (status FAILED)"
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/payments/orders/{{unpaidOrderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "success": true
}


### 12. The eggs are back on the shelf (nothing reserved for this order any more)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/inventory/8
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 13. The customer was told (payment failed, order cancelled)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 14. Admin: failed payments
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments?status=FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 15. Admin: money in and out this month (online paid, cash collected, refunded; India time)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 16. Admin: a summary longer than a year -> 400
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments/summary?from=2025-01-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 17. Customers cannot see the summary -> 403
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
